#: src/ui/login.rs:156
#, rust-format
msgid "Sirensong {version} • not affiliated with Spotify"
msgstr "Sirensong {version} • 與 Spotify 無關"

#: src/ui/login.rs:170
msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Client ID. It is 32 letters and digits, shown on "
"your app's page in the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"這看起來不像用戶端 ID。用戶端 ID 由 32 個字母和數字組成，顯示在資訊主頁中你的"
"應用程式頁面上。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:174
msgid ""
"Spotify doesn't know this Client ID. Copy it again from your app's page in "
"the dashboard."
msgstr "Spotify 無法辨識此用戶端 ID。請從資訊主頁中你的應用程式頁面重新複製。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:178
msgid ""
"Spotify didn't let this account use the app. Sign in with the Spotify "
"account that created it, which needs Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 不允許此帳戶使用該應用程式。請使用建立該應用程式的 Spotify 帳戶登入，"
"該帳戶需要 Premium。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:182
msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Sirensong used before. Set up "
"your own Spotify app to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 已不再接受 Sirensong 以前使用的共用登入。請設定你自己的 Spotify 應用"
"程式以繼續收聽。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:219
msgid "A native Spotify client."
msgstr "原生 Spotify 用戶端。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:233
msgid "Waiting for Spotify in your browser…"
msgstr "正在等待瀏覽器中的 Spotify…"

#: src/ui/login.rs:241
msgid "Didn't open? Open the sign-in page again"
msgstr "沒有開啟嗎？重新開啟登入頁面"

#: src/ui/login.rs:257
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your app exactly, save, "
"and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"如果 Spotify 顯示「Invalid redirect URI」，請將 {uri} 原樣新增到你的應用程"
"式，儲存後重新登入。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:310
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "使用 Spotify 登入"

#: src/ui/login.rs:321
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Sirensong never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"透過瀏覽器登入。Sirensong 永遠不會看到你的密碼。本機播放需要 Spotify "
"Premium。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:330
msgid "How to set up your Spotify app"
msgstr "如何設定你的 Spotify 應用程式"

#: src/ui/login.rs:354
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Proxy 設定"

#: src/ui/login.rs:409
msgid "A Client ID is 32 letters and digits. Copy it from your app's page."
msgstr "用戶端 ID 由 32 個字母和數字組成。請從你的應用程式頁面複製。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:461
msgid "Set up your Spotify app"
msgstr "設定你的 Spotify 應用程式"

#: src/ui/login.rs:469
msgid ""
"Sirensong signs in through your own free Spotify app. Spotify requires its "
"owner to have Premium."
msgstr ""
"Sirensong 透過你自己的免費 Spotify 應用程式登入。Spotify 要求應用程式擁有者具"
"備 Premium。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:479
msgid "Open Spotify's developer dashboard."
msgstr "開啟 Spotify 開發人員資訊主頁。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:498
msgid "Click Create app. Any name will do."
msgstr "按一下「Create app」。名稱不拘。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:505
msgid "Under Redirect URIs, add exactly:"
msgstr "在「Redirect URIs」中準確新增："

#: src/ui/login.rs:514
msgid "Tick Web API, accept the terms, and save."
msgstr "勾選「Web API」，接受條款並儲存。"

#: src/ui/login.rs:523
msgid "Paste the app's Client ID into the field and sign in."
msgstr "將應用程式的用戶端 ID 貼到欄位中並登入。"

#. Translators: shown on the Copy button for a moment after it copied.
#: src/ui/login.rs:558
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "已複製"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:401
msgid "Spotify is being slow on the shared app."
msgstr "Spotify 在共用應用程式上回應很慢。"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:404
msgid ""
"Sirensong no longer offers the shared app, and Spotify can stop accepting it "
"at any time. Set up your own free Spotify app and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Sirensong 已不再提供共用應用程式，Spotify 也隨時可能停止接受它。設定你自己的"
"免費 Spotify 應用程式，就不用再等了。"

#. Translators: a button that opens a page explaining why
#. the banner it sits in appeared.
#: src/ui/mod.rs:414 src/ui/mod.rs:445
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "為什麼？"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:437
msgid ""
"Spotify refused the key that unlocks the audio. Sirensong can't fix that, "
"but it sometimes clears up on its own. You can still play on your phone or "
"another Spotify device."
msgstr ""
"Spotify 拒絕提供解鎖音訊的金鑰。Sirensong 沒辦法解決，但有時過一陣子會自己恢"
"復。你仍然可以在手機或其他 Spotify 裝置上播放。"

